  "body": "YESTERDAY, TODAY, TOMORROW\r\n\r\nA once-in-a-century opportunity awaits-29.45 hectares of gently contoured land. Proposed Light Industrial.\r\nBecoming available for the first time in 100 years. Having been farmed by the same family for generations, this property holds a rich history and a promising future. Positioned right beside the motorway, it boasts both accessibility and exposure, making it a highly desirable investment.\r\nLand of this scale is a rarity, and the long-term value is undeniable. With major infrastructure developments already in motion-NoR 1 (Rapid Transit Corridor), NoR 3 (Rapid Transit Station), NoR 4 (SH1 Improvements), and NoR 8 (Dairy Flat Highway)-this location is set to become a strategic hub, enhancing connectivity and urban expansion.\r\nOpportunities here extend beyond just owning land; they align with forward-thinking urban planning:\r\n*\tIntensification Focus - Council zoning prioritizes higher-density developments around transit hubs, ensuring a vibrant and growing community.\r\n*\tRapid Transit Access - Positioned near key transport stops, this land is ideal for future residential, commercial, or mixed-use development.\r\n*\tMDRS Expansion - With three-story structures permitted under the MDRS framework, this property offers the potential for dynamic urban growth without the burden of extensive consent processes.\r\nWhile some aspects-such as water and sewerage infrastructure-require time to be fully realized, this property is a one-time investment with limitless potential. The location, the scale, and the impending transport enhancements make this a prime acquisition for future success.\r\nAct now-opportunities like this don't come around twice in a lifetime!\r\n\r\nViewing by appointment only.\r\n\r\nTo view the property files click the following link: https://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/95YZ",
